 "content": "Based on the information from the blog, which of the following statements about XP and UML are true?"}], "type": "question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "Both approaches are essential when designing software products. "}], "id": 0}, {"correct": true, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "Both modeling approaches are used to sketch the workflow of software projects. "}], "id": 1, "text": ""}, {"correct": false, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "When sketching a program, you can combine both approaches."}], "id": 2, "text": ""}, {"correct": true, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "They both can relate to AM principles."}], "id": 3, "text": ""}, {"correct": false, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "They both offer a relaxed schedule for programmers."}], "id": 4, "text": ""}, {"correct": true, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "They are both alike because they offer similar tools. "}], "id": 5, "text": ""}], "id": 0}], "type": "MMM", "template_override": 1, "id": 2}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "How can the software creation process be carried out?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 2"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\"